<title>NEW ZEALAND: Mr Chips half yr profit rises to $633,000.</title>
<headline>Mr Chips half yr profit rises to $633,000.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    0.63 vs 0.54</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    2.5 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  4.1 vs 3.5</p>
<p>    Turnover				    8.57 vs 8.39</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     0.95 vs 0.80</p>
<p>    Tax					   0.31 vs 0.26</p>
<p>Shares outstanding (million) 15.4 vs 15.4</p>
<p>Pay date Dec 20</p>
<p>    Ex div   Dec 16</p>
<p>Note - Mr Chips Holdings Ltd is a food manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
